HELP.md
.gradle
build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### Project-specific ###
# Vue build output is copied here by `vite build` / the Gradle node plugin — generated, not source.
src/main/resources/static/
# Sidecar bundle is copied here by the sidecarBuild Gradle task — generated, not source.
src/main/resources/sidecar/
# Sidecar bundle extracted from the jar at runtime, relative to the server working dir.
_claude-sidecar/
# Scratch working dir used by the SDK-migration spike scripts (sidecar/spike*.mjs).
_spike_cwd/
# Scheduled-task artifacts created at runtime, relative to the server working dir.
_claude-tasks/
# Server-scheduler task store + run reports created at runtime (claude.server-schedule.store).
_claude-server-tasks/
# Web-push VAPID keypair + browser subscriptions created at runtime (claude.push.store).
_claude-push/
# Lucene full-text index built at runtime (claude.search.index-dir).
_claude-search-index/
# Telegram UI settings (incl. the bot token) persisted at runtime (claude.telegram.store).
_claude-telegram/
# Local screenshots / scratch
_shot.png
# Local Claude Code project settings — never publish.
.claude/
# Local machine config overrides (e.g. your LAN subnets in claude.security.allowed-cidrs) —
# Spring Boot loads ./config/application.yml automatically. Never publish.
/config/
# Self-signed TLS keystore — generated locally by scripts/gen-cert.bat. Never commit private keys.
certs/
*.p12
# EXCEPT the test fixture (junk key, never used for a real listener) — CertificateController tests.
!src/test/resources/certs/
!src/test/resources/certs/test-keystore.p12

